# Deleting records. Rules keep history safe: in-use records answer 409 with what to do instead.

@token = PASTE-AN-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@workflowId = PASTE-A-WORKFLOW-ID
@senderId = PASTE-AN-AGENT-ID
@contactId = PASTE-A-CONTACT-ID

### A draft or finished campaign (409 while enrollments run or another workflow uses it)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/automation/workflows/{{workflowId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### An agent that never sent (409 otherwise: switch it off with PATCH /senders/{id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Erase a contact and every copy of their data; the address stays suppressed (admins)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### How the console signs in (public): dev, or OIDC authority/client id for "Sign in with Microsoft"
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/config
